\par\par \b \uc2  Dlr steady vs euro, yen seen gaining from Kosovo. \b0\par\par\uc2 395 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 April 1999\par 01:37\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TOKYO, April 20 (Reuters) - The dollar was steady against the yen and the euro in early Asia on Tuesday, but the yen was likely to maintain a firm tone as a fund outflow from Europe into Asia could continue amid the Kosovo crisis, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "People are pulling money out of Europe and putting it in Asia as there seems to be no near-term solution to the Kosovo crisis. The yen, the Australian dollar and the Singapore dollar are the main beneficiaries," said a dealer at a trust bank. \par \par \uc2  The dollar was at 117.52/55 yen at 2305 GMT, compared with 117.55/65 yen late on Monday in New York. The euro was at $1.0655/60, also unchanged from New York. \par \par \uc2  The euro dropped to a new low of $1.0589 overnight after comments by European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  (ECB) President Wim Duisenberg. \par \par \uc2  Duisenberg told a European Parliament committee on Monday that the ECB had not reached the point where it was worried enough about the euro rate for large scale \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  He also shocked the market by describing the ECB's current stance on \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  as one of neglect. \par \par \uc2  "Not having an exchange rate policy, and we do not have one, does not mean there is benign or malign neglect. For the time being there is neglect," Duisenberg said. \par \par \uc2  Against the yen, the euro fell as low as around 124.85 yen overnight, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The key level to watch for the euro/yen was 124.62, the record low set on January 11, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  But some dealers said profit-taking buy-backs could support the euro before it tests new lows. \par \par \uc2  "Short-covering in euro/dollar was very heavy after the euro set a new low overnight. Some people are starting to get bored of selling euro on the Kosovo factor alone," said a dealer at a city bank. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the market also remained wary about possible dollar-buying \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Such fears were likely to increase when the dollar approaches 115 yen, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Japan's top financial diplomat Eisuke Sakakibara said on Monday that Japan would act decisively against premature, excessive rises in the yen. \par \par \uc2  ((Tokyo Treasury Desk, +81-3-3432-9780 \par \par \uc2  tokyo.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010908dv4j02njd\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
