\par\par \b \uc2  Tokyo Stks Open Higher; Brazil Impact Minimal \b0\par\par\uc2 261 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 Januar 1999\par 01:38\par \uc2  Dow Jones Asian Equities Report \par \uc2 AER\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  TOKYO (Dow Jones)--Tokyo stocks are opening moderately higher Thursday as a weaker yen lends support to share prices, participants said. \par \par \uc2  Key indexes fell in early trading after U.S. and European markets dropped on news Brazil would widen the trading band for its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets are stable, and Japanese share prices are already at low levels," said Sachio Ishikawa, general manager at the stock division at Chuo Securities. "The direct impact of the Brazil move is not great." \par \par \uc2  At 0030 GMT (7:30 p.m. EST Wednesday), the Nikkei average of 225 selected issues was up 62.23 points at 13,465.83. \par \par \uc2  The near-term March Nikkei 225 futures contract was trading at 13,450, up 10 points. \par \par \uc2  Early Wednesday, Brazil's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  president resigned and his replacement immediately announced a widening of the official trading band for the real. \par \par \uc2  In New York, the Dow Jones Industrial Average closed at 9349.56, down 125.12 points, or 1.32%, on the news. The average lost as much as about 261 points in early trading. \par \par \uc2  More important for Tokyo, participants said, is the yen/dollar exchange rate. \par \par \uc2  Large exporter shares took a beating in recent days as the value of the yen rose against the dollar until the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  jumped in to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  Tuesday, driving the yen back down. Early Thursday in Asia-Pacific trading, the dollar is trading around Y113.15, about Y1.62 higher than Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires  14-01-99 \par \par \uc2  0115GMT \par \par \uc2  5011 55117 \par \par \uc2 Dokument aer0000020010824dv1e005ru\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
