\par\par \b \uc2  Exchange Rate Issues To Top ASEM Fin Mins Agenda Fri, Sat \b0\par\par\uc2  By Ellen Thalman \par \uc2 396 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 Januar 1999\par 19:35\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  FRANKFURT (Dow Jones)--International exchange rate stability will top the agenda when European Union and Asian finance ministers meet Friday and Saturday in Frankfurt, along with \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  and the widening of the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  band for the Brazilian real this week. \par \par \uc2  Recent calls for a new international financial architecture - primarily from Germany, Japan and France - are likely to be brought up with International Monetary Fund Managing Director Michael Camdessus and Bank for International Settlements' Managing Director Andrew Crockett, who will be at the meeting with the 25 ASEM ministers. \par \par \uc2  Separately, deputy finance ministers from the Group of Seven industrialized nations will hold a meeting immediately following the ASEM gathering on Saturday afternoon, which also is likely to center on \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  issues. \par \par \uc2  The G-7 deputies Wednesday had a conference call to discuss Brazil \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  President Gustavo Franco's resignation earlier in the day and the subsequent move to widen the real's band against the dollar to BRR1.20-1.32 from BRR1.12-1.22. The real fell by around 9% immediately after the change. \par \par \uc2  Camdessus's attendance at the ASEM meeting might heighten expectations of tangible proposals on exchange rate stability. \par \par \uc2  But a German government source said the meeting won't yield much more than a dialogue between participants. "I don't expect any concrete result from this meeting," he said. "The conference will serve more as a forum to exchange ideas in the aftermath of the euro and the Asian financial crisis." \par \par \uc2  Camdessus will primarily address key points about financial market transparency outlined at the May 15 Birmingham G-7 summit, a German Finance Ministry source said. \par \par \uc2  At the ASEM meeting, the first major event in Germany's six-month E.U. presidency, German Finance Minister Oskar Lafontaine is likely to to drum up more support for closer international cooperation to prevent sharp moves between the euro, the dollar and the yen. \par \par \uc2  Recently he has toned down earlier calls to create trading bands among those \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , in an effort to rally broader support for his ideas. \par \par \uc2  Those calls have received support recently from Japan, when Prime Minister Keizo Obuchi suggested a similar \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  plan during his trip over the last week in Europe. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 13-01-99 \par \par \uc2  1835GMT \par \par \uc2  1194 4211 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv1d00af2\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
