\par\par \b \uc2  SIMEX Nikkei futures edge up with eye on dlr/yen. \b0\par\par\uc2 281 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 Januar 1999\par 03:55\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2      SINGAPORE, Jan 13 (Reuters) - SIMEX Nikkei futures notched \par \par \uc2  up modest gains on Wednesday morning as the market kept a wary \par \par \uc2  eye on the yen's strength against the dollar after the Bank of \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2      "The market is mainly range-trading today waiting to see if \par \par \uc2  there will be more \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," one trader said. \par \par \uc2      "If the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  steps in again to support the dollar, \par \par \uc2  the Nikkei should see further gains," the trader said. \par \par \uc2      "But if the dollar sticks between 110 to 113 yen, I don't \par \par \uc2  think they'll touch it and the Nikkei should move sideways." \par \par \uc2      Traders said the dollar's rebound against the yen eased \par \par \uc2  worries about Japanese exporters' earnings, but some investors \par \par \uc2  maintained a bearish outlook for the dollar. \par \par \uc2      "A lot of investors are sidelined to see where dollar/yen \par \par \uc2  heads next," one trader said. \par \par \uc2      Traders said Nikkei futures would move in a range of \par \par \uc2  between 13,210 and 13,520 over the next few sessions. \par \par \uc2      SIMEX Taiwan stock futures lost ground as Taipei stocks \par \par \uc2  fell after overnight losses in the U.S. Dow Jones index and \par \par \uc2  technology-heavy Nasdaq index. \par \par \uc2      SIMEX NIKKEI 225 FUTURES Contract...... MAR9....... JUN9 \par \par \uc2  Last..........13445.........0 High..........13445.........0 \par \par \uc2  Low...........13290.........0